# Keep the Docker build context lean — node_modules/.git/build-output never need to be sent to
# the daemon; the Dockerfiles COPY only the specific source paths they need. Shared by both
# apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (both build from repo root) — don't exclude either
# app's src/, both Dockerfiles need theirs.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
coverage
**/coverage
.turbo
.pnpm-store
.git
.gitignore
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.claude
devops
docs
infra/DEPLOY.md
**/*.md
apps/api/test
apps/web/test
